      { cmd:`ip addr show eth0`, output:`2: eth0: &lt;BROADCAST,MULTICAST,UP,LOWER_UP&gt; mtu 1500\n    inet <span class="ok">10.0.4.12</span>/20 brd 10.0.15.255 scope global eth0`, reading:`Filtering to just one interface — same command, one argument added — useful on a machine with several NICs when you only care about one.` }
