    getPods: { syntax:`kubectl get pods`, cmd:`kubectl get pods`, output:`NAME                     READY   STATUS    RESTARTS   AGE\nweb-7d8f9c6b5d-abcde     1/1     <span class="ok">Running</span>   0          2h\nweb-7d8f9c6b5d-fghij     1/1     <span class="ok">Running</span>   0          2h`, does:`Lists pods in the current namespace, with status and restart count.`, where:`The single most-run kubectl command — checking whether your app is actually running.` },
